<!DOCTYPE html>
<html dir="rtl" lang="ar">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>منصة صفي</title>
    <style>
        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Cairo:wght@400;700&display=swap');

        body {
            font-family: 'Cairo', sans-serif;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at center, #1e3c72, #2a5298);
            margin: 0;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            color: white;
        }

        .glass-box {
            background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
            backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
            padding: 50px;
            border-radius: 40px;
            text-align: center;
            box-shadow: 0 20px 40px rgba(0,0,0,0.3);
            width: 80%;
            max-width: 350px;
        }

        h1 { font-size: 2rem; margin-bottom: 10px; }
        p { opacity: 0.8; margin-bottom: 30px; }

        .grade-card {
            background: white;
            color: #1e3c72;
            padding: 25px;
            border-radius: 25px;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.4rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            display: block;
            transition: 0.4s;
        }

        .grade-card:hover {
            transform: scale(1.05);
            background: #f0f0f0;
        }

        .icon { font-size: 4rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 20px; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="glass-box">
        <span class="icon">📘</span>
        <h1>مرحباً بك</h1>
        <p>منصة صفي التعليمية</p>
        
        <a href="/subjects" class="grade-card">
            عاشر عام
        </a>
    </div>

</body>
</html>
